an style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Does the proposed project include clearly outlined plan and realistic mechanisms that will lead to widespread dissemination of project results, including national electronic communication systems, publications and presentations at professional society meetings?</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n			</ul>\r\n\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; vertical-align:top; width:80px\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; vertical-align:top; width:536px\">\r\n			<ol start=\"10\">\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#01172f\">TIMELINE:</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></li>\r\n			</ol>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; vertical-align:top; width:80px\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">10 points</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; vertical-align:top; width:536px\">\r\n			<ul>\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#3e3e3e\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Is the timeline for completion </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">the project provided?</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#3e3e3e\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:black\">Is the research plan </span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">realistic/or feasible/ </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:black\">achievable within the proposed project term (not to exceed one year)?</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#01172f\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Is there adequate time or given for completion of each stage and the sequence for completion logical?</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n			</ul>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; vertical-align:top; width:80px\">\r\n			<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; vertical-align:top; width:536px\">\r\n			<ol start=\"11\">\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#01172f\">BUDGET AND COST-EFFECTIVENESS::</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></li>\r\n			</ol>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; vertical-align:top; width:80px\">\r\n			<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; vertical-align:top; width:536px\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Budget </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n			<ul>\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#3e3e3e\">Are the budget itemizations/costs reasonable and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">necessary or </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#3e3e3e\">appropriate?</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Is the budget request sufficiently detailed and justifiable? </span></span></span></span></li>\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Will the total budget be adequate to carry out project activities? </span></span></span></span></li>\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Have all anticipated expenses been included?</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n			</ul>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; vertical-align:top; width:80px\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">10 points</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; height:81px; vertical-align:top; width:536px\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Cost-effectiveness </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n			<ul>\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Is the proposed project cost-effective? </span></span></span></span></li>\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Does it demonstrate a creative use of limited resources? </span></span></span></span></li>\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">maximize research value and output&nbsp; with a minimal financial resource</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n			</ul>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; height:81px; vertical-align:top; width:80px\">\r\n			<ol>\r\n				<li style=\"list-style-type:none\">\r\n				<ol>\r\n					<li style=\"list-style-type:none\">\r\n					<ol style=\"list-style-type:lower-roman\">\r\n						<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">poin</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n					</ol>\r\n					</li>\r\n				</ol>\r\n				</li>\r\n			</ol>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; vertical-align:top; width:536px\">\r\n			<ol start=\"12\">\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#01172f\">REFERENCES, LANGUAGE AND WRITING STYLE</span></span></span></strong></span></span></li>\r\n			</ol>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; vertical-align:top; width:80px\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">5 points</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; vertical-align:top; width:536px\">\r\n			<ul>\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#3e3e3e\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Does the proposal provide a list of cited references? </span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#3e3e3e\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Are the references current and relevant?</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#3e3e3e\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Is uniform citation style used appropriately in the reference list?</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#3e3e3e\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Californian FB&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Are references cited appropriately in the literature review, theoretical framework, and description of methodology?</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n			</ul>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; vertical-align:top; width:80px\">\r\n			<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-03 09:54:51','Assessment Guideline  filee3d79d1fe891748f6782ba2f9c5aea99.pdf','Grading Form a05203794667f4c9115b3e664ffad999.docx','Evaluation Report Form d76c5ef88f1cfbe570708a3fbccbdfce.doc');
