INSERT INTO `review` VALUES (12,16,262,85,'14615e65c1337cb92ddc5776316766ed.pdf','<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times&quot;,serif\">There is a gap in the conceptual/ theoretical framework. Because in this section the investigators are expected in include the conceptual or theoretical framework supported / linked to the research problem.</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The objectives stared from number 1-6 are all about the implementation status. The remaining objective (7) is on barrier and best practice.&nbsp; I do not think that it will be answered using such statement. This is&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">qualitative part and needs further rearrangement. In addition to this, objectives 5 and 6 can be mixed together and treated as one objective.</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The qualitative approach is not clearly included in this section.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">In Study design and participants, it needs clear presentation who are your study participants. Because in one of the paragraphs indicated 50 % health post and in the other all health post. Is is not familiar to estimate number of sample size in qualitative research.&nbsp;Over all the method of qualitative approach is not properly presented.&nbsp;This project proposal will have good input for strengthening e-CHIS in specific and enhance community health in general</span></span></p>','2021-12-11 14:58:21','3',NULL,'f2ab85f839ebb54b5caf9af8461072d4.pdf',NULL,NULL),(13,148,83,61,'44760d06ca32358b12bf4d15e8048c8b.pdf','<p>The comments are attached in the reviewed document file as an evaluation report!</p>','2021-12-07 14:36:11','2',1,'8bcdf715df76e5fa140edc9a66157cce.pdf','2021-12-18 12:29:57',NULL),(14,139,83,88,'465485bee8963f8d75bfb94a33387422.pdf','<p>Comments attached as evaluation report below in the reviewed document file</p>','2021-12-07 14:36:45','1',1,'ab8c94107201c6cf833122ecb0688a16.pdf','2021-12-17 14:31:12',NULL),(15,122,83,44,'3c32ab4b8fc34b0e61ed57c39cfcabd7.pdf','<p>comments attached as evaluation report in the reviewed document file</p>','2021-12-07 14:37:26','1',1,'ff230a03d538f1a88f36d083a6db2fa6.pdf','2021-12-17 15:08:17',NULL),(16,26,262,76,'b7fdb59da052764ca3bc83d75160a7ba.pdf','<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The title neither appropriate explain the problem to be investigated&nbsp; nor Clearly reflect of project content. Besides quality does not only indicate efficiency of some things there are other additional parametrs.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">There is no summary in the document </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The problem or opportunity to be addressed by the proposed project is not adequately identified, It does not address a regional or national problem(s) and in line with the national thematic areas. The literature review is not enough to identify what is known about the problem or the proposed innovation and identify gaps. The conceptual framework or theoretical perspective identified to support the work is not presented described. &nbsp;The project does not address a regional or national problem(s) and does not explain about the national thematic areas.&nbsp;There is limitation on the innovative and creative thinking and not that much new to the field of study.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The goal of the project does not similar or do not explain the topic. There is variation between the goal and the specific objectives. The specific objectives are not clearly described. Probably it might be difficult to measure the first objective. The relationship between the specific objective and the title should be clearly indicated. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">There should be clear explanation between the quality, efficiency and the specific objective</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The citation about the study setting and the duration is not included. The investigators should include the starting and the ending period of the project instead of writing probability time period (&ldquo;<em>Shall be one year&rdquo;)</em></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Do you think by the listed Source population and study population can be solved the research projec</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">I hope health professional are also source and study population</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">What does it mean &ldquo;<em>Data will be visualized using run charts and assessed for improvement&rdquo;?</em></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">There is no any plan of dissemination </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The budget is not justifiable </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Very few references</span></span></p>','2021-12-11 14:51:27','1',1,'c8c1b6a955f1f0a56c148c8f09a214be.pdf','2021-12-17 14:42:04',NULL),(17,84,273,27,'ad3bd0f2b78130aa03989f6ccadbe655.pdf','<p>This research asses the microbial quality of milk from producer to consumer. It will provide&nbsp; information in relation with the risk of infection, AMR pattern at human animal interface and the potential source of infection. I recommend this project to be funded by JUIH with modification indicated in the attached document.</p>','2021-12-07 10:45:44','2',1,'010109cf31b1dd5bf87fda5ca9a7e1d7.pdf','2021-12-17 15:41:45',NULL),(18,85,273,35,'50ed706392629bc8d85a403ce225cd36.pdf','<p>AMR in hospital environment is agrowing concern. Dozens of studies are already published on bacteria profile and AMR at inparient and out patient settings including 3rd generation cephalosporing. As per my knowledge there is no enough scientific justification to study ceftazidime resistance without knowing the AMR pattern againes other betalactam and cephalosporins.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thus, I am sorry I would not recomend this proposal for funding. Please find attached my detail comments in the evaluation report attached.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-07 11:08:43','1',1,'5fe17eac5a360bb4c4af81dcf5c19015.pdf','2021-12-17 15:42:21',NULL),(19,87,273,77,'2569fcd2489aca443971dcdf141c7ce2.pdf','<p>LBP prevalence is already reported from other previous studies done in Ethiopia. There is no enough reason to assume the prevalence would be different in Jimma. The proposed RCT to asses the effect of standard excercise in improving LBP was not methodologically clearly described in the document. Thus, I am afraid I would&#39;nt recommend this proposal for funding.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Please see the detail comment given in the attached document</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Best</p>','2021-12-07 10:53:58','1',1,'7f946fffdc0d6e8c2d158e333ca2fbe8.pdf','2021-12-17 15:01:07',NULL),(21,86,273,40,'c107e67daa37722f5928780e00f29c61.pdf','<p>Occupation health&nbsp; is one of the neglected public health problem in Ethiopia. The health risk associated with chemical physical and pschological hazards in coal mining industry is not well studied. However, the proposal needs major revision and I have indicated my comments in the attached review report document. Thus, I recommend this proposal for funding if the investigators revise the document as per the suggestions.</p>','2021-12-07 11:01:00','2',1,'2281b90c0ac102db773565bdba7da1ae.pdf','2021-12-17 15:00:15',NULL),(22,83,144,40,'38710790d294b8780658a4fb15d9d8b2.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-06 17:43:43','3',1,'ad859d12a601ea19c526f94af89e95b1.pdf','2021-12-17 15:00:29',NULL),(23,82,144,77,'02886d379a0624f86747fa93fb88815c.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-06 17:49:31','2',1,'da1114999071ff8f246c3fd4391db23c.pdf','2021-12-17 15:01:12',NULL),(24,31,144,74,'7f66e13c02dfd4431522db184c251730.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-06 17:53:04','2',1,'ef97ce47be84cf16418133a91ee08278.pdf','2021-12-17 14:48:09',NULL),(25,30,144,4,'4419fb7126db153fdd709e2b3de9e725.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-06 17:55:06','2',1,'e765774687f58c2ac5c2913a9ab2e0ea.pdf','2021-12-17 14:39:26',NULL),(26,138,279,88,'2cfb0b9dc7e82e134f51425218293a00.doc',NULL,'2021-12-07 13:13:13','1',1,'d092dbd7ef2d5b8d35e8983c45790d34.docx','2021-12-17 14:31:19',NULL),(27,73,271,43,'d0874a19d7d5eead8191f6dd19d1a05a.pdf','<p style=\"margin-left:48px\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Dear Sir,</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;The area worth to be studied but investigators need more time/data to justify it.</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Details in the evaluation form and grading forms attached.</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Regards,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Diresibachew</strong></span></span></p>','2021-12-07 14:15:19','1',1,'c5e40926f47396991a8b23019dbac38a.pdf','2021-12-18 12:19:07',NULL),(28,151,279,72,'e4e9435f1be28d9ea4811766da23a7e9.doc',NULL,'2021-12-08 08:56:26','3',NULL,'ca666d75d96b29c757d4096cb0026e72.docx',NULL,NULL),(29,149,279,58,'716eb087899b01f0f108f58a98ac8dd7.doc',NULL,'2021-12-08 09:08:44','1',1,'f6c7aaef98f84268c31ee90715e70c6c.docx','2021-12-17 15:35:52',NULL),(30,137,279,84,'09774d0f700e675e33545394ca842fb5.doc',NULL,'2021-12-08 09:18:27','3',1,'911c2c08ca8f35c08ca7fe5846e21a5f.docx','2021-12-17 15:11:13',NULL),(31,136,279,57,'6ce03d8682d6183c4eca85c68aec4140.doc',NULL,'2021-12-08 09:47:24','1',1,'ee38114936d9d7fb86fa84aabb077540.docx','2021-12-17 15:35:10',NULL),(32,71,271,15,'21e873e7b3da5615587d7aa87056e1a7.pdf','<p>Pls see files ataached.&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-08 13:55:19','2',1,'06c5facb3eee619dde8e414681d332a1.pdf','2021-12-18 12:15:03',NULL),(33,124,44,45,'5b6cb1d2ff81396d787db75993d3a580.pdf','<p>This proposed project has to be revised comprehensively with possible accceptance. I have put the detailed comments within the given sections according to the guideline parameters.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>','2021-12-08 15:46:12','2',1,'5301ca6247d832e582631508e43f6c94.docx','2021-12-17 15:09:07',NULL),(34,107,44,13,'a87a3fe5039ab55ef63b98426b13cb02.pdf','<p>This work has a good contents and clearly detailed, despite it is not a new study even for the specific study area.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is accepted with recmmending minimal modifications. Specific comments have put within the given section.</p>','2021-12-08 15:54:40','3',1,'828164c306f95c5ccf1c0ffbd22d64ee.docx','2021-12-17 15:02:47',NULL),(35,68,271,20,'b3bd2c4917b00a97196311a7d496007a.pdf','<p>Pls see files attached</p>','2021-12-08 16:30:55','1',1,'212fb779502fb6a45141aa2ed2eb9e16.pdf','2021-12-18 12:12:22',NULL),(36,17,260,32,'c1381ff928386ffb17d05f9a935d5771.pdf','<p>1. Why on earth does the Jimma University fund projects of relevance for the population residing in the Capital. Addis Abeba University and other institutions residing in the capital should find it. This study purely luck relevance to the community living in Jimma.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Autism is not a disease concern of low resource settings. There&#39;s is a limited study to begin with that is observational which points out the magnitude of the problem in Ethiopia. It is not fair to just run into a clinical trial with some nutrient without properly understanding the disease prevalence and other important contributing factors with established cohorts. Feasibility and acceptability of clinical trials are the norms, even to think of clinical trial first. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-08 17:01:06','1',1,'2470402ae041243b8cd1afa9212e55ce.pdf','2021-12-18 12:11:05',NULL),(37,80,150,38,'554405539ac51f8dbb3fca787c60a849.pdf','<p>Dear JIH Research Director,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This mega research very important in addressing RH challenges among adolescents/ highschool students; and it could be heplful in resolving STI problems. Besides, it will cultivate the baseline for improving responsibility highschool studnts sexuality.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With Regards,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hailemariam Hailesilassie (Assistant Professor)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Psychiatry Department</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Jimma University, Jimma, Ethiopia.&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-09 13:18:04','4',NULL,'fe7866781e72574e556a4c3e11cd1f08.pdf',NULL,NULL),(38,69,271,24,'ae9b4f9e69e98b1b01a6faf4cfd81e1c.pdf','<p>Pls see files attached&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-09 17:46:40','3',1,'01283aa0e8749f88f97df07afe53578c.pdf','2021-12-18 12:12:59',NULL),(39,81,150,21,'d715605d0ea7dca4b576ec3c93fe26a2.pdf','<p>Dear JIH Reserach Director,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This research looks innovative to mental health non-pharmacolgical treatment. However, at this stage, it is not SMART. It lacks details on how to, research evidences, methodological gross deficits.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But, it will have huge impact on multiple aspects of health if clearly addresses the observed gaps.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With Regards,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hailemariam Hailesilassie (Assistant Professor)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Psychiatry Department, JU, JImma, Ethiopia.</p>','2021-12-09 18:18:23','1',1,'aa475f3f0622c8f4f1d0d66368023ceb.pdf','2021-12-18 12:06:20',NULL),(40,170,31,6,'e4a0deca8a45747e2e0b1db88a1b9fe6.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-10 12:36:08','4',1,'ebab548ac2a23e86caadbaf9862a0c5e.pdf','2021-12-18 12:09:14',NULL),(41,169,31,16,'d7f70372ed6617f7dda61c5624620ef2.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-10 12:38:28','2',1,'e702bc99b98b1f0b0d24adbd7e7b5d9c.pdf','2021-12-17 15:48:05',NULL),(42,168,31,67,'2bb23d7ab5a2fb598fd1ea76772970dc.pdf','<p>The one I reviewed is different from the title given here at the top!</p>','2021-12-10 12:46:46','3',1,'e825de33cbc8e305e26f286660469289.pdf','2021-12-17 15:44:11',NULL),(43,60,267,69,'f37673d7958f51565b36cd3c9ab87fab.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-10 15:44:44','2',1,'e322aa4da1bb146593655521411844ab.pdf','2021-12-18 12:00:42',NULL),(44,59,267,64,'e1332dc9cf7d8c4c1cabf34cf984a2f4.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-10 15:52:38','2',NULL,'adfead20fe8ec2f796866159eb81072a.pdf',NULL,NULL),(45,34,267,31,'3173b2c3a78ef8fe92e6226a2f0bd203.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-10 15:57:45','3',NULL,'ac8fe257d4998787b13934b30df16e80.pdf',NULL,NULL),(46,39,62,86,'f89d1ff6574820ae31cb18d08cb6f047.pdf','<p>The research topic is relevant and timely given the potential of mHealth to improve health delivery in LMICs. However, the proposal has the following limitations:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Review of related literature/ related works:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:40px\">Detailed literature review should be conducted to find out state of the art on the topic and this proposal doesn&#39;t present any.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Objective:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:40px\">The major objective of technology adoption studies is not to evaluate but to identify major factors and barriers for adoption. Evaluation is part of the object but not the main goal of such stuies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Methodology:</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:40px\">The choice of TAM as an adoption study model is not well motivated and justified. The reason as to why other models were not selected should be stated.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:40px\">How the survey instrument will be adopted from TAM is also not well articulated in the methods section.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Overall assessment:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As the authors don&#39;t seem to have conducted a detailed review of the literature review and missed critical points on the objective and method of the study, I strongly recommend rejecting this title and they present it for another call with proper preparations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-15 12:18:51','1',1,'03feb142fb273c583a40a4b5079724e6.pdf','2021-12-17 14:59:12',NULL),(47,56,267,60,'4afa0c23ae780db46b656d5b50e5f345.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-10 16:02:28','3',1,'5124e253c27a004853e8d37f44e2a4fa.pdf','2021-12-18 11:36:40',NULL),(48,57,267,62,'e6967e218f0561230f625440b6d339ac.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-10 16:06:20','1',1,'c96d46fc2fe475a8a9cffdbe54f345c7.pdf','2021-12-18 11:45:28',NULL),(49,58,267,63,'39598af5d5f735afa572e7a63249f184.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-10 16:10:23','3',1,'1ee943b2eccc7c99f75dacfe14f8a774.pdf','2021-12-24 11:54:19',NULL),(50,131,32,49,'bb866d46c0f692e00c57c5c24fcfeb59.pdf','<p>All comments regarding the proposal are given and written in the comment box.</p>','2021-12-20 20:16:02','2',1,'e31e4631e66e13a7500de501ad333ae0.pdf','2021-12-17 15:33:00',NULL),(51,134,262,52,'5e2258047e5fbc3142f7baccb676f0e0.pdf','<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The title appropriate to problem investigated and Clear reflection of project content. In addition to this title carries the appropriate meaning and covers the study carried out. The length of the title is also fair.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">But in the title said the magnitude, where are in the specific objectives it says prevalence. Better to be consistent.</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">In the summery section of the research project,</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">the question or issue clearly stated and the &nbsp;significance of the work is not clearly explained. The investigators &nbsp;generally stated the significance as &ldquo;<em>Therefore, the purpose of this study is tried to solve this gap at Jimma zone, Southwest Ethiopia</em>.&nbsp;The gaps should be listed and elaborated further&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The introduction started with definition of term, has started evidence from global to Africa. The possible causes are listed and the previous interventions tried also included. &nbsp;The gap to be field by the project is also described.But the conceptual framework or theoretical perspective identified to support the work is not presented.&nbsp;Except for the community-based study nothing is innovative. This research is done in Jimma university medical center.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The specific objective 1 and 2 can merged as one objective and the number of objectives can be minimized to 4.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">This is mixed approach. There are various types of mixed method. </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Here the investigator&nbsp; stated that &ldquo;<em>Community-based cross-sectional study supported by qualitative findings will be conducted among adults in Jimma zone, Southwest Ethiopia&rdquo;. </em></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">I do not think that the qualitative is supportive rather it independently have its own objective those are in the fourth and fifth in the main document<em>.&nbsp;</em></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">So needs detailed presentation with the qualitative method in addition to the quantitative one<em>.</em></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">It is impossible to estimate the number of sample size in qualitative research it is determined by the saturation level. The number of focused groups determined by saturation and the variables included.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Generality there is rule of thump but not before data collection, qualitative design is emergent design.&nbsp;The dissemnination section is not fully addressed.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The laboratory test section budget seems under estimated. Is it going to be done in private or public. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">There are various tests blood, urine.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">130,320/ 844= 154.40 birr.&nbsp; Do you think all the investigation can be covered by 154.40 birr. Revise it again.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-10 18:33:01','4',1,'e3587cc7812e9be410952909fd683fc5.pdf','2021-12-23 11:48:27',NULL),(52,66,262,11,'859d931dfacdd88d3726244ff97c1600.pdf','<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The stud is going among mother or the intervention is going to be done mother. Better to include some thing the mention mother in the title.&nbsp;No summery in the document/ proposal.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">There is a problem the sequential presentation of the on the epidemiology of malnutrition in the introdcution section.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The investigators put empirical evidences from the global level, the from Africa such as Kenya, and then global.&nbsp;Make it very clear the and specific in some of your paragraphs.&nbsp; Some of the paragraphs are about breast feeding, complementary feeding, and the others are exclusive breast feeding. Which of those issues are you going to address? It is obvious exclusive breast&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">feeding and complementary feeding are types feeding practice in children .Try to define some terms such exclusive breast feeding, complementary feeding and so on. some reader might be confused.The significant of the study is not clearly presented. It is very difficult to understand for reviewers what problem you are going to solve. because of mixing up of idea, and poor chronological ordering of ideas.&nbsp;Making a randomized controlled trial by is self is Good. But mobile health interventional studies have been done in different colleges and universities including Ethiopia and even in Jima university.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">There some variation between the title, the goal and the specific objectives. The term &ldquo;<strong>Peer &ldquo;i</strong>s included in the specific objectives. But this was not included in the title&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&ldquo;PINC&rdquo;, such abbreviations should first explain&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">the paragraph under the study design is not clear. It seems the objective of the study.</span></span><em><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&ldquo;Anthropometric measurements (weight and length) will be collected at birth and at 12 months to compare growth between the two groups&rdquo;. </span></span></em><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">In this paragraph you have to indicate that the measurement will be taken for the infants&nbsp;</span></span><em><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">In addition, Cleary; specify what information, where to get, when to collect&nbsp;</span></span></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">For example, look the following pa</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><em>&ldquo;Recruited and trained field workers will conduct a total of six interviews with the mothers, at the hospital (the first interview), over the phone and at home (the final interview) to collect the data (Table 2).&rdquo;&nbsp; </em></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">What does it mean six interviews, why do you conduct six interviews, what is the importance?</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The date collection tools and technics needs further description and elaboration&nbsp;I could not find the plan of dissemination in the project proposal .The budget is seems fair.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">over all Interesting project idea, it would have input for&nbsp;then overall health of infants when the comments are corrected and done based on the planed..</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-10 18:49:26','3',1,'2b5fec76718c6a99021a89a44f297f46.pdf','2021-12-18 12:10:25',NULL),(53,117,270,39,'e9d1701fc0466b33a9c3c949473b3503.pdf','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The intended objectives might not be achieved with this specific geography and the aforementioned disease condition.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Either it should cover a larger geography or very common disease which could have bigger effect than COVID 19</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The need for this research should be explained in details</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>','2021-12-10 21:06:22','2',1,'b6e9862ebf498b02918470b33aa190c0.pdf','2021-12-17 15:06:05',NULL),(54,115,270,37,'830dadca87ddcfc14824d657a7cbc5be.pdf','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The same researches has been conducted in Addis Ababa and other places. Therefore, the rationality of this research has to be explained very well.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The need for this research should be explained very well</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>','2021-12-10 21:10:20','3',1,'d41cc420de45a022d0616002c9c3c309.pdf','2021-12-17 15:05:35',NULL),(55,64,270,82,'f8120ee09c85f888800d8a2ca20b1a66.pdf','<table cellspacing=\"0