t&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-14 12:48:43','1',1,'588db6586bc4b1cb1a69a8bb514bb607.pdf','2021-12-17 14:49:05',NULL),(63,118,275,42,'160920cb63b898b9f5fc45ea38b9234f.pdf','<p>The study &nbsp;is not fit for a mega project of &nbsp;first-generation universities especially the JU benchmark</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mostly this is fieldwork mainly based on field control, a few of the more management aspects need to be included for the appropriate management of not only Neglected Tropical Diseases but also other water-borne diseases.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-14 15:09:09','1',1,'b8fc316e6b65e40de6552b62242bcad9.pdf','2021-12-17 15:07:34',NULL),(64,133,65,52,'6955d9ab1e5d5e9e393ad9212501adaf.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-11 12:22:20','1',1,'c02dbe8b0cb4e5c0d1a74210769b3552.pdf','2021-12-23 11:47:57',NULL),(65,102,65,48,'1786872daecfe68a98fbfac6086726d4.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-11 12:23:52','3',NULL,'b7a830acb327006b1cd13c354a732c64.pdf','2021-12-17 14:33:43',NULL),(66,105,65,80,'88e860896aa3e773f54d78e119b24831.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-11 12:25:36','1',1,'839aa90255f062c99203ab22a20ef754.pdf','2021-12-17 15:09:43',NULL),(67,127,32,3,'b7537f65559182cce7fb8db444b995e8.pdf','<p>All the comments are raised in the comment box.</p>','2021-12-11 12:32:02','2',1,'d4933099b23e2a185b05f01b5c8ae8e6.pdf','2021-12-17 15:12:37',NULL),(68,147,153,28,'a3618d89951f96084acb078949bb2bf3.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-11 13:47:39','3',1,'3baff4235252bd355518d7e8b15aa33a.pdf','2021-12-18 12:07:35',NULL),(69,116,153,39,'2a73e4e881125544cd11a3774f53ea72.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-11 13:49:22','1',1,'7d9d4d1c53fade27ee739a79b53cf4d0.pdf','2021-12-17 15:06:10',NULL),(70,135,153,57,'c9909979326c86fa82e8c73b361df289.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-11 13:50:51','1',1,'f8a45f4b1dbe15a83d0f89f3f89be87f.pdf','2021-12-17 15:35:14',NULL),(71,114,153,37,'2a46fee56835624e15d85917590baa29.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-11 13:53:37','1',1,'272bb8c63556c06a31a7ca5b651f6968.pdf','2021-12-17 15:05:41',NULL),(72,111,275,29,'942133d6b396191b8492448bbd4d5da7.pdf','<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The study is good and innovative as the COVID-19 is challenging the entire world so such a study may help in the diagnosis and prognosis of the disease as well as it will give the idea to clinicians in managing the fatalities.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The study is fit for a mega project of first-generation universities and in line with the JU benchmark.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-14 15:24:11','3',1,'5386ca1e82c7e62b91a6c27f9756c893.pdf','2021-12-17 15:01:59',NULL),(73,110,153,29,'cbe4b190a1888589696d7b18474b59be.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-11 14:04:12','2',1,'0974b154456a87d4f61e131621330410.pdf','2021-12-17 15:02:03',NULL),(74,130,65,34,'9864895821102cb15dc971211348cc13.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-11 14:25:24','1',1,'0bda64aa8db69c8e405020af154e1622.pdf','2021-12-17 15:34:14',NULL),(75,65,262,6,'e10e99ef043cd26b1035caadd41ff061.pdf','<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The title do not fully reflect about the general goal and objectives. There are issues about exclusive breast feeding, eclampsia.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">What does this term mean. &nbsp;&ldquo;foetal&rdquo; growth, look the document for such mistakes .</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The significant is mention but it is different from the research questions and research objectives.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&ldquo;<em>this study aimed to <strong>clarify</strong> the impact of Khat chewing on dietary intake, breast milk quality and birth outcome of new-born infants in Jimma Zone</em>.&rdquo;&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">What does the term clarify means? Is it good to use the term clarify in such study.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Impact of Khat chewing&mdash;in- in dietary intake </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Impact of Khat chewing&mdash;in- breast milk quality</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Impact of Khat chewing&mdash;in-breath outcome </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">please revisit this significance with the hypothesis, research question and research objective.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The presentation on the problem is not systematically presented .</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The problems presentation is not clearly and properly explained, it mainly focused n the composition and content of khat. Unnecessary copy past of statements and paragraphs occur.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">What is the advantage of adding &ldquo;<em>Since khat consumption affects the dietary intakes of pregnant women.&rdquo; &nbsp;</em>In the hypothesis? This indicates that if khat consumption do not affect the dietary intake, it will not affect, it will not affect the milk production.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">In addition to this you sated that the significant of the stud is &ldquo;<em>this study aimed to <strong>clarify</strong> the impact of Khat chewing on dietary intake, breast milk quality and birth outcome of new-born infants in Jimma Zone</em>.&rdquo; </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;you are not sure whether the khat consumption affect dietary intake. When formulating hypothesis, you should consider the sample, predictor, and outcome variables only. No need of unnecessary statement<strong>.</strong>Generally, be very clear on the significance goal, objective, hypothesis, research question</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Sample is pregnant mothers, you predictors is khat&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">chewing and the outcome variable are low birth weight and milk production.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">In addition to this is you hypothesis one-sided or two- sided. Because the is a difference in formulating hypothesis.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">There is confusion. In this section, the investigators are talking about, exclusive breast feeding, occurrence of eclampsia. This indicates lack of consistency of clarity on the general goal and objective of your study.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">More or less your research objectives should inline with your title, general objective and the research question, there is variation specially in the research questions and research objective in content and number.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The source population. Study population and the inclusion criteria in not clear.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">In the sample size calculation, you mention two groups who are those groups. Pls clearly specify.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">One of the dependent variables is &ldquo;Milk composition&rdquo;.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">How are you going to measure?</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Your plan of data collection is anthropometric measurements. Is the anthropometric measurements about the infant or the mothers.??????</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">You plan to collect protein, fat, lactose, total dry matter, and energy contents of breast milk by measured by spectrophotometry. so what will be your standard to say those milk contents are normal range, low, high or absent.&nbsp;I haven&rsquo;t found the plan for dissemination.&nbsp;Better to consult language editors to produce better research outcome is possible. Because this research seams first I kind and will have great impute for the scientific community. I am not sure about the professional who are in this project. but better to consider various professionals&hellip;.midwife, laboratory, nutrition professionals etc or you can consult them .&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Generally this project is cceptable with minor modification.</span></span></p>','2021-12-11 14:29:52','3',1,'f7349af941549c9e602e7427b2de0e60.pdf','2021-12-18 12:09:21',NULL),(76,36,262,50,'e07847360c72c89ad693e8267bd11295.pdf','<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The title is not appropriate to problem investigated and Clear reflection of project content. The specific objectives of the project are not addressed in title.&nbsp;The title is like simple cross-sectional research and does not seem as mega project. in the summary section,&nbsp;Neither &nbsp;the question or issue clearly stated in the abstract nor the significance of the work clearly and adequately presented.&nbsp;The definition of terms should come first before you proceed directly to the coverage of intermated based services. The investigators started from Ethiopia about the title. It as better to start from the global to&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">national. The chronological order in inappropriate. In addition to this the relationship between the internet based and the chronic health problems is not clearly explained. The importance or the gap that is going to be field by this project is not convincing.&nbsp; I could not seen&nbsp; &nbsp;innovative ideas in this project.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><em>&nbsp;&ldquo;To explore the perception of health care providers towards internet-based health information utilization from chronic patient&rsquo;s perspectives&rdquo;</em></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The above objective going to be explored using qualitative method. Why do you ask health professional perception about chronic patient? </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">It is better either to interview the patients themselves or doing FGD. The perception of one individual can not be measured by the perceptions of the other.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The difference between objective 1,2 and 3 is not clear. There is either some confusion or &hellip;&hellip;&hellip;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">They can be modified in to two objectives.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The qualitative research method is not properly addressed. The investigators estimate the number of the sample size in I the qualitative method. During the mixed method , there are various ways. In this research project , it is not clear which one are they plan &nbsp;to apply. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">unstructured questionnaire might not visible for this study. Better to use the semi-structure interview guide.&nbsp;It is not justifiable why you plan to use All variables with p&lt;0.25 in the Bivariate analysis will be included in the final model of multivariate analysis in order to control all possible confounders. What is the condition to use 0.25 instead of 0.05? the dissemination section is&nbsp;Partially addressed.&nbsp;The budget is to some extent exaggerated why compared with the outcome that it will have.&nbsp;Some of the references are too old.&nbsp;Better in make some interventional study of mobile health in minimizing the poor health outcome of the chronic patients and your team composition should include specialist such health informatics professional&rsquo;s. &nbsp;you budget should be justifiable </span></span></p>','2021-12-11 14:46:04','2',1,'372a98604ec27ccde0020d5eb04b0f98.pdf','2021-12-17 14:50:21',NULL),(77,157,285,3,'e2ad0fe4258c39f19bb8c4d26a1ffa49.pdf','<p>Similar to clinical investigations.&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-11 15:58:32','1',1,'1c6c60667f0355295c59597976482eb4.pdf','2021-12-17 15:12:40',NULL),(78,163,285,21,'89903fbb1ae82156ccb5bf0e7683931d.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-11 16:01:24','3',1,'a4bffbefcf30267f4927b8c06f8fc850.pdf','2021-12-18 12:06:51',NULL),(79,160,285,30,'42905ea829fdb439aee5fb2b0790e47f.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-11 16:10:01','2',1,'c0b717171b04f67f384ad4a7d9903c3f.pdf','2021-12-18 12:08:10',NULL),(80,161,285,81,'9d00249751285020a074de1dad6479fb.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-11 16:15:39','1',1,'53450254638d0c03ddb993758a6da552.pdf','2021-12-18 12:08:46',NULL),(81,158,285,34,'4d4d97bc4082aec08f238a5a14590822.pdf','<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Title of the project: Investigation of&nbsp; diabetic&nbsp; management&nbsp; adequacy&nbsp; and&nbsp; treatment&nbsp; outcomes&nbsp; among&nbsp; diabetic patients as well as in&nbsp; vivo&nbsp; antidiabetic activity evaluation and characterization of selected medicinal plants in Jimma zone</span></span></p>','2021-12-11 16:20:47','2',1,'856d3444c0da17243469e9d6e93abfe1.pdf','2021-12-17 15:34:22',NULL),(82,70,271,65,'f9023f26f386f8c6dd6485951ebf1d12.pdf','<p>Pls see files attached.</p>','2021-12-11 17:12:06','3',1,'ad35a37e6b6f5fceaabcc186cbed6b6f.pdf','2021-12-18 12:13:31',NULL),(83,154,282,78,'5663579a5f33e2a75b7444d26c47ebf1.pdf','<p>&nbsp;There is Major Methologicakl issues and feasibility</p>','2021-12-11 17:54:26','2',1,'26a01897e26f831d74f4b00c9a00dc40.pdf','2021-12-17 15:37:54',NULL),(84,150,282,72,'5f56a9884dcb1310dd29b2a534ae4ffd.pdf','<p>Main concern is around methodlogy&nbsp; plus I did not see it s innovative approach. ( details of comment are attached!</p>','2021-12-11 17:59:57','2',1,'29911c9f1ebfb363d6e58b508b2f6fd5.pdf','2021-12-17 15:36:57',NULL),(85,153,282,72,'862aa0ebf2336a72ba38b3b9dcaa5a8c.pdf','<p>major isues around methodology plus I did not see&nbsp; innovative apprach ( details comments are attached</p>','2021-12-11 18:04:13','2',1,'e56ddb8e7932592caf8ed76cb9ac1c40.pdf','2021-12-17 15:37:02',NULL),(86,72,271,18,'2ecd78e4e877285c0573d82b40c69b20.pdf','<p>Pls see files attached.&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-11 18:12:06','1',1,'dbebac012d750c79335f3a4b26623ae5.pdf','2021-12-18 12:15:42',NULL),(87,35,61,50,'b996fdd4da04587d3c2711abd724e3eb.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-14 12:49:42','1',1,'772ec61a85466274bd33dbce356e7ea9.pdf','2021-12-17 14:50:30',NULL),(88,182,277,17,'4f49afdcf04165e1a0c5fe5d0bf8701a.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-11 19:36:26','1',1,'2175c6e3cdd582ade79ddabbff31853c.pdf','2021-12-17 15:48:51',NULL),(89,120,275,44,'e832f60383bd268d6178a659bf63a6c4.pdf','<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Similar studies have already been conducted in the region, there is no innovation in the project. This type of study is an example of parallel research which will not give a boost to the institute to be a frontline research institution in the country.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The study &nbsp;is not fit for a mega project of &nbsp;first-generation universities especially the JU benchmark</span></span></p>','2021-12-14 14:53:37','1',1,'d026a00fc9cd16758887172c4cf0b39c.pdf','2021-12-17 15:08:21',NULL),(90,125,277,8,'169dea39c9fb86677237d1715a30bb7f.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-11 19:38:17','1',1,'6df6067525f59db0a0be0e1901b26969.pdf','2021-12-17 15:13:08',NULL),(91,113,275,33,'67b891ecafb9c7d3e25c3eb60e0c642d.pdf','<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Similar studies have already been conducted in other settings, there is no innovation in the project. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The study is not fit for a mega project of first-generation universities especially as per the JU benchmark.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-14 14:37:24','1',1,'f643fbc411b752423ad8897db750e404.pdf','2021-12-17 15:03:50',NULL),(92,109,275,14,'09b06913921131bed6e43740687ab58f.pdf','<p>Similar studies have already been conducted in other settings, there is no innovation in the project, however, the acceptance level of vaccines may be a useful study. The study is not fit for a mega project of first-generation universities especially as per the JU benchmark.</p>','2021-12-14 14:43:00','1',1,'d821ab825ef77eebfc79c583adb8a44b.pdf','2021-12-17 15:03:17',NULL),(93,106,275,13,'e368860e752a107f4dc4626f61149a58.pdf','<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Similar studies have already been conducted in other settings, there is no innovation in the project. &nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,se