e design to conduct the research will be susciptible for ethical issues and unacceptable to the human kind. Its highly recommended to modifiy the the research methodolgy.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-12 15:07:48','1',1,'66f1c886426f5b91a148c2ccffa58c62.pdf','2021-12-18 12:11:12',NULL),(112,14,261,41,'324cbe11040fb2492892c3f7200ad5f7.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-12 16:39:01','4',1,'59fe8cf7997e646ec19c826590915873.pdf','2021-12-18 13:24:38',NULL),(113,20,261,10,'9064061230b9ab1a5f965aab9e472d64.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-12 15:20:44','3',1,'e7497df5661a4e411c702d4e5b588e71.pdf','2021-12-18 12:09:49',NULL),(114,19,263,10,'f8cb40a02131cdbdc50c16d7b45ca092.pdf','<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,sans-serif\">Mental illnesses have been overlooked as a major health priority in Ethiopia and other LMICs, and underscore the need for public health programs targeting mental illnesses with nutritional lens. Thus, understanding the contribution of eating behavioral pattern on mental health and identifying interventions that can minimize the roaming epidemic is of paramount importance. </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,sans-serif\">Therefore, I strongly recommend to support /fund this&nbsp;project </span></span></span></p>','2021-12-12 15:31:10','4',1,'d956863b718c14aa8e50efc3b74df8cd.docx','2021-12-18 12:09:52',NULL),(115,196,287,78,'ca69d557a454c850ac5f853532b85204.pdf','<p>the current research is a single one, not mega research project and lacking institutional capacity enhancement like including at least one PhD&nbsp; and an MSc studnets. Besides that since it is retrospective one, the project panned a huge money that need only to collect data from secondy one(records). More detailed and comments are given in the evaluation formate under each section.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Accordigly, I found the proposed project is unfit for the award, hence <strong>Rejected</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Thanks for the invitation!</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>And I will continue to help your office as my part for quality research that would enhacne our global impact.</strong></p>','2021-12-12 15:33:54','1',1,'452d152f6107df27709947b951b62889.pdf','2021-12-17 15:37:59',NULL),(116,198,293,62,'8f926d246d65b2d43c5294007b9863db.docx','<p>I have rejected the proposal because I found the research proposal was not well articulated. The details is uploaded here.&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-12 16:09:28','1',1,'896e915d7d4274df494bda3cbb8b0c38.doc','2021-12-18 11:45:32',NULL),(117,199,293,12,'88fcd6f472c64ad1e46e47700cca4c84.doc','<p>The proposal is not complet and it lacks basic component of the proposal like timelines workplan budget breakdown....&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-12 16:15:05','2',1,'d2225eb1b584261e948e48c1e7cd8fe5.docx','2021-12-17 14:39:08',NULL),(118,200,293,67,'f9d43d3073c82c6ec3653becaa22bcb8.doc',NULL,'2021-12-12 16:17:02','2',1,'4237f8a366042de872103406cf6f5190.docx','2021-12-17 15:44:16',NULL),(119,132,261,49,'ca4c555a8efaedece75ea1f4279ff0d6.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-12 16:37:54','2',1,'8eaf6cae62b6ee49c60ba547ba4371a7.pdf','2021-12-17 15:33:19',NULL),(120,174,286,70,'5664cf5a929e4ad08be3f459041ac59c.doc',NULL,'2021-12-12 16:58:40','4',1,'9db18e76b874546b3aa4c450e8cc0c95.docx','2021-12-17 14:45:44',NULL),(121,171,286,54,'93a5c0ba8a4df0ec4828f021d5b6cdd5.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-15 16:13:35','1',1,'25fb1a3f80f29629aa83cca956ee2bcc.pdf','2021-12-17 14:35:30',NULL),(122,180,261,16,'865fd4629b62ff090eebd7453f6087a5.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-12 17:22:46','3',1,'a95a24d69a2d51e9d20898e5dd9dec1c.pdf','2021-12-17 15:48:09',NULL),(123,112,276,33,'23f7dff42b6ee751e1b075e7af20e20b.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-12 17:33:28','1',1,'203d4f483e5e30cfca3ef2add585d61c.pdf','2021-12-17 15:03:54',NULL),(124,123,276,45,'