#39;&#39; obstetric violence &#39;&#39;</p>','2021-12-13 11:24:07','3',NULL,'b8dcafca237470f848d5f5e02cf9c584.pdf',NULL,NULL),(134,50,266,19,'adf5e21a71a2fe72348b1c883266f658.pdf','<p>Dear ;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Greetings ;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Here under uploaded is the fed back on the review of the mega project titled &#39;&#39; Compliance of women&#39;s pelvic floor muscele excwecise&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-13 11:32:28','1',1,'5eb123473f3a2824c3fa0862c05b2934.pdf','2021-12-17 15:49:42',NULL),(135,49,266,17,'558f45c230ddf4d9447dcf88779aa1d1.pdf','<p>Dear;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Gretings;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Here under uploaded is the feedback on the review of mega project titled &#39;&#39;The effect of social suppoert to improve healthy prgancy .</p>','2021-12-13 11:35:24','1',1,'7b5fe947f729bd9e69da281c9683eeb3.pdf','2021-12-17 15:48:55',NULL),(136,32,266,74,'c718931e0be535ab60dfb301a4b957e5.pdf','<p>Dear;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Greetings ;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hwere under uploaded is the feedback on the review of mega project titiled &quot;development of&nbsp; emergency health logistic management.</p>','2021-12-13 11:41:16','3',1,'92f3d921774f3c291454b63d45c56fdb.pdf','2021-12-17 14:48:13',NULL),(137,201,294,59,'bdb07753541306e13232fc587322fac6.pdf','<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Title</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">: EXPLORING RESILIENCE: UNDERSTANDING THE IMPACT, AND DEVELOPING COMPREHENSIVE RESILIENCE MODEL OF COVID-19, JIMMA ZONE, SOUTH WEST ETHIOPIA: DEVELOPING COMPREHENSIVE RESILIENCE MODEL OF COVID-19 </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Dear Authors</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">,    </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Thank you for submitting your proposal to Jimma University Research and Innovation Director</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">As a reviewer, I have completed my evaluation of your proposed project. I recommend reconsideration of your project following minor revision and modification. When revising the aforementioned proposal, please consider all issues mentioned in the comments and suggestions carefully: please outline every change made in response to the comments and provide suitable confutations for any comments not addressed here. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Title &amp; Abstract: </span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The title is by the theme of the article and appropriate to the problem to be investigated and a clear reflection of the project proposed. However, it requires modification. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">In Abstract, it is a pity that the text is affected by the poor quality of language usage, weak flow of ideas and literature yielded information. Please avoid indicating the synonymous of words in brackets. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Try to explore original words, show the depth of the knowledge gaps and significances fitting for the community, health care providers, and health policymakers.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Rather than reporting well-known facts about COVID-19 or where and where the synergy of Covid 19 is, try to focus on resilience as a crucial factor in enlightening and mitigating the community challenges by the pandemic. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">What is the intention of the authors when writing, &ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">In-depth interview and FGD guide will be utilized to explore the live experience of COVID-19 recovered on the impacts of Covid-19 and resilience to develop a comprehensive resilience framework which <span style=\"background-color:yellow\">helps to fight back the impacts of the pandemic</span>?&rdquo;</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">ATLAS.ti.7.1 will be used for coding and higher-level analytic categories. What do you mean by <span style=\"background-color:red\">higher-level analytic categories</span>? Explain.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Background and Rationale</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">This section is very superficial and did not rely on the literature very effectively. References could be added to better explain the challenges of COVID-19 impacts, copying or practicing resilience during COVID-19 and its responses from global to national.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Paragraph 1, Line 5 indicated that &ldquo;All these things are creating&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;..leading to heightened levels of anxiety. <strong>Explain</strong>.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Paragraph 2, line 1&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip; It should start as, &ldquo;Due to Covid-19 impacts.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The proposed project goal is tremendous!</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Objectives </span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The objectives are applicable and relevant. However, large numbers of objectives sometimes lose the tract of the reader and spoil the validity of the work. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Methods and <u><span style=\"background-color:lime\">Participants</span></u></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The methods are unclear and not replicable. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The Authors loosely indicated data collection tools and data collection procedures. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">No, the pilot test is mentioned. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Is there any tendency to uncover participants&rsquo; perceptions via FGD?</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Clearly state the number of data collectors and facilitators, proposed in this survey.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Briefly describe the techniques of FGD.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">*******participants identification is perhaps the most critical step since the technique is largely based on group dynamics and synergistic relationships among participants to generate data. So, how are you going to identify the target group among the community? How are you going to assign participants to get honest and spontaneous views? Are you going to consider a homogenous or heterogeneous group? WHY?</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Several respondents in each FGD is not stated. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Convenient, comfortable venue and levels of distraction are not stated.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">FGD usually yields both qualitative and observational data where analyses can be demanding, which the authors are mentioned nonentity. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The proposed FGD should be removed unless the authors come with convenient techniques to be functional. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Population</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The authors write as, &ldquo;As we expect &hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;resilience of fighting the Covid 19 pandemic impacts.&rdquo; I don&rsquo;t understand this.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">What type of scale or data collection tool is going to be used to explore relevant information for each specified objective?</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">The investigator should justify the specific types of focus group discussion (Single way, Two-way focus group, Dual moderator, etc), in this platform.</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">It should be noted that participant recruitment and selection is a key modality in FGD. However, the investigators did not report their sampling and participant recruitment procedures.</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The researcher did not indicate how to deal with the possibility that the participant&rsquo;s failure to express their honest and personal opinions about the topic at hand, specifically during FGD.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Sample size and sampling procedure</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The Authors indicated that all patients treated and discharged from the COVID center of JMC and Shenen Gibe Hospital to be included in the study. OK!</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">But explain how prepared interview guide and response to the guide is going to suggest data saturation.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">How to trace and contact the participants? Is there any system developed for example for feedback, identifying patients, follow-up with contacts, or providing support after discharge, under the Covid center of the targeted hospitals? What if there is relocation, out of Jimma? </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Study design and participants</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">*****check van Manen approach and see how it fits with your study.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The authors should provide details on how they negated response bias.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">A diagrammatic representation (flow chart) of the plan of the study would be useful.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">What themes will the authors expect from the interview?</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Show the inclusion and exclusion criteria.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Questionnaire</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">As a data collection tool, the Authors didn&rsquo;t forecast general and exploratory questions.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">It should be noted that the authors&#39; plan to take time to carefully plan the questions is worthy of note. Avoid worded, biased, or awkward questions that can derail the FGD and spoil the quality of the data.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Is there any criterion in the literature to establish trustworthiness to ascertain accuracy in this study?</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">How do you plan to check the validity of the data?</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The proposal requires English editing to correct the grammar, typographical errors, and flow of ideas. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Finally, significance is there any standard intervention to improve the resilience of patients with </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Covid-19? What do you think?</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:yellow\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">POTENTIAL SUGGESTION:</span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Amend the survey through unstructured in-depth interviews based on the native language of the participants. The final status of the project depends on the proposed FGD (which was not described effectively) and how the authors react to the aforementioned comments. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Institutional enhancement capacity/capacity</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Two MSc students are mentioned. But their field of study and contact information (e-mail address) is not specified. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Budget Breakdown</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Revise budget itemizations/costs reasonably and appropriately.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The budget request is not sufficiently detailed and justifiable.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">For example;</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Under Data collection,</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">== how are you planning to run data collection for subsequent of 30 days?<strong>EXPLAIN</strong>.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"2\">\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Explain the cost allocated for the data transcription. <strong>30 data??, 2000 unit cost??, etc</strong></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">If the authors are unsuccessful to convince for the superfluous FGD, descriptions (4 through 6) will be worthless and need to be removed. </span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Revise the stationary cost;</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">=== Example, Recorder.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px; text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-13 12:18:03','2',1,'3da78a0bf70408079ddeee47771caa8a.pdf','2021-12-17 14:41:21',NULL),(138,24,264,9,'18c723e00e3f6022f1bda234465b7933.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-13 15:13:08','1',1,'e79b641cbd38e2c787303f1fed9cea09.pdf','2021-12-18 12:05:29',NULL),(139,38,264,53,'18e6751d88a65017fbc67a348a2d5bc3.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-13 15:16:35','4',NULL,'165bf0c8df13179a91b084a053043992.pdf',NULL,NULL),(140,40,264,86,'53d87191cc49d7ca174548a0af4dfa33.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-13 15:17:35','1',1,'c142de83591f8088c180287478d88e09.pdf','2021-12-17 14:59:17',NULL),(141,52,264,26,'b9513a434b4e7f8ea007c685a388ce81.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-13 15:19:27','1',1,'a3f68c3a0f123f38e4ad07fd2fbcefa5.pdf','2021-12-17 15:50:59',NULL),(142,53,264,36,'fd89bbde16021f8ad843bd69004167e7.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-13 15:20:15','1',1,'e6e6d83b03f878e5a95a0803d56b87d3.pdf','2021-12-21 14:01:59',NULL),(143,54,264,38,'b8fd572507c5cf660877f28daa3bd89d.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-13 15:20:56','4',1,'a3f6d943c61309419354fb106dd9756c.pdf','2021-12-18 11:36:17',NULL),(144,67,268,7,'733312f99cbbdf912fa8b97f2d472e70.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-13 17:19:55','4',1,'e3ed162d648560aea30e2831441573fd.pdf','2021-12-18 12:11:47',NULL),(145,41,268,22,'4542e7475db56c04939d289a589b4a68.pdf','<p>This type of research will answer antimicrobial-resistant problems that must be encouraged.</p>','2021-12-13 17:52:34','4',NULL,'a88ff7edafb6f3845634bbf04a054bc1.pdf',NULL,NULL),(146,44,268,35,'a471123457b5d38b090eb541e3d0693f.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-13 18:21:13','1',1,'fe80deacf72ceefa5d7d54e0274a671f.pdf','2021-12-17 15:42:27',NULL),(147,42,268,27,'390b08a7abe9817fc39c3f7cad9b5fac.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-13 20:10:31','1',1,'919d2e509645b49aeaf1a876aff29cb8.pdf','2021-12-17 15:41:50',NULL),(148,119,157,42,'76d8024bf9a7517aaa4e19064aea436e.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-13 20:14:32','1',1,'86d94c6cc26905ed06196db3b0cf547f.pdf','2021-12-17 15:07:38',NULL),(149,45,268,46,'97f87ec85b0fee8075fbe2f4b9207701.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-13 20:28:06','1',1,'012ec2cdf108d2b923dc32482f868498.pdf','2021-12-17 15:43:06',NULL),(150,108,157,14,'64f66595bf561d6f797303f06b4b8e0d.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-14 15:00:21','1',1,'82df8764e44bfc511246ee5904ae2062.pdf','2021-12-17 15:03:24',NULL),(151,46,268,56,'433bc59fb4d627c7dbf3f5eb8d20c802.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-13 21:22:05','4',NULL,'e26ede3aa475e7623a9864b0c8019f4d.pdf',NULL,NULL),(152,48,269,73,'5a92364a196cba5ed085ad37bc863d21.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-13 21:22:24','3',1,'b9048f022118108346eadd9197c737e7.pdf','2021-12-17 15:40:11',NULL),(153,185,291,26,'3bdf548d1a144dbcda6e14d24a25a633.pdf','<p>I recommend major revision before acrepting for funding</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you</p>','2021-12-14 00:04:35','2',1,'81a88c6a6037848ca61892dffc06d6b5.pdf','2021-12-17 15:51:03',NULL),(154,15,260,85,'a7390ad9ac7fda9503c715032b9e945c.pdf','<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">This research has a master&#39;s student level of complexity (in terms of innovation) and societal relevance.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">It also does not consult the country&#39;s health sector transformation plan.&nbsp; Therefore, this study&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">suffers to important limitations to be considered for funding</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">1. There are at least three projects currently at JU funded by various funding organizations so it is a duplication of efforts and perhaps might even have a conflict of interest</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">2. The ultimate outcome of this project is the evaluation of the e-CHIS, however, what innovation would have been to develop new features or update existing ones, please kindly refer to the Ethiopian latest Health Sector Transformation Plan.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">3. Compared to the other proposal submitted in this field, I found this less innovative. It is purely evaluative with no promise for innovation</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>','2021-12-14 10:03:45','1',1,'53298d0f95920682d1d3ccef79ddf3df.pdf','2021-12-17 14:58:04',NULL),(155,176,290,20,'5a78ece4298b79d088837b377f21b026.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-14 14:42:50','1',1,'51a2b0f4bd9ba6609aec59c2f4cabd7b.pdf','2021-12-18 12:12:26',NULL),(156,177,290,11,'aff703a47a89aef5ff574478d6fc94dd.pdf',NULL,'2021-12-14 14:44:36','2',1,'90f3d99de06698c4ad8b02ad7d70e508.pdf','2021-12-18 12:10:40',NULL),(157,184,291,23,'1ef92d287c68d84b3a1a3c246be2b9fe.pdf','<p>The proposed study is assessment study via a traditional approach.</p>','2021-12-14 17:03:31','1',1,'02043e3fc3503320b0bbae5a693a936c.pdf','2021-12-17 15:50:24',NULL),(158,202,298,8,'f75ab439cbf26cdf50922f0a720066fb.pdf',NULL,'202