sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Gillespie, S., et al., <em>The politics of reducing malnutrition: building commitment and accelerating progress.</em> Lancet, 2013. <strong>382</strong>(9891): p. 552-69.</span></span></a></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\"><a name=\"_ENREF_22\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">22.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The Sackler Institute for Nutrition Science and The New York Academy of Sciences, <em>A global research agenda for nutrition science </em>2013, The Sackler Institute for Nutrition Science/The New York Academy of Sciences: New York.</span></span></a></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\"><a name=\"_ENREF_23\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">23.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; WHO/UNICEF, <em>Clinical management of acute diarrhoea</em>. 2004, World Health Organization &amp; United Nations Children&rsquo;s Fund; : Geneva &amp; New York.</span></span></a></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\"><a name=\"_ENREF_24\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">24.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; UNICEF, <em>Pneumonia and diarrhoea: Tackling the deadliest diseases for the world&rsquo;s poorest children</em>. 2012, United Nations Children&rsquo;s Fund: New York.</span></span></a></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\"><a name=\"_ENREF_25\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">25.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Tamrat, T. and S. Kachnowski, <em>Special delivery: an analysis of mHealth in maternal and newborn health programs and their outcomes around the world.</em> Matern Child Health J, 2012. <strong>16</strong>(5): p. 1092-101.</span></span></a></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\"><a name=\"_ENREF_26\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">26.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Piette, J.D., et al., <em>Impacts of e-health on the outcomes of care in low- and middle-income countries: where do we go from here?</em> Bull World Health Organ, 2012. <strong>90</strong>(5): p. 365-72.</span></span></a></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\"><a name=\"_ENREF_27\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">27.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; UNICEF, <em>State of the world&#39;s children 2015</em>. 2015, United Nation&#39;s Children Fund: New York.</span></span></a></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\"><a name=\"_ENREF_28\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">28.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; UNICEF Somalia and Somaliland M