 Standards Institute, 950 West Valley Road, Suite 2500, Wayne, Pennsylvania 19087 USA.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:32px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">Disassa, N., Sibhat, B., Mengistu, S., Muktar, Y., &amp; Belina, D. (2017). Prevalence and Antimicrobial Susceptibility Pattern of E. coli O157 : H7 Isolated from Traditionally Marketed Raw Cow Milk in and around Asosa Town, Western Ethiopia. <em>Veterinary Medicine International</em>, <em>2017</em>, 1&ndash;7.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:32px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">Eshetu, M., Yirda, A., &amp; Kassa, F. (2020). Microbial Quality and Safety of Raw Cow Milk in Girar Jarso District of Oromia Regional State, Ethiopia. <em>Eth. J. Anim. Prod.</em>, <em>19</em>(1), 37&ndash;55.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:32px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">Fesseha, H., Mathewos, M., Aliye, S., &amp; Wolde, A. (2021). Study on Prevalence of Bovine Mastitis and Associated Risk Factors in Dairy Farms of Modjo Town and Suburbs, Central Oromia, Ethiopia. <em>Veterinary Medicine: Research and Reports</em>, <em>12</em>, 271&ndash;283.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:32px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"