g the implementation of complex interventions in health care: the normalization process model. BMC Health Serv Res. 2007;7(1):148.</span></span></span></li>\r\n				<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">MOH. Health and health related indicators conversion factor, 2014 EFY (unpublished).</span></span></span></li>\r\n				<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Murray E, Treweek S, Pope C, MacFarlane A, Ballini L, Dowrick C, May C. Normalization process theory: a framework for developing, evaluating and implementing complex interventions. BMC Med. 2010; 8(1):63.</span></span></span></li>\r\n				<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">World Health Organization, 2012 WHO verbal autopsy instrument. </span></span><a href=\"https://www\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">https://www</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">.who.int/healthinfo/statistics/verbalautopsystandards/en/index2.html, 2012.</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n				<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Lincoln, Y.S.; Guba, E. Naturalistic Inquiry; Sage Publications: Beverly Hills, CA, USA, 1985.</span></span></span></li>\r\n			</ol>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>','To determine  the level of Hypertensive Disorders, Health Seeking Behavior for Pre-eclampsia and Lived experience with pre-eclampsia among pregnant women in Jimma Zone, South Western Ethiopia, 2022',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'Hypertensive disorders, Pregnant women, Pre-eclampsia, Jimma Zone, South Western Ethiopia.',10,'<table align=\"left\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Table\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border:none; margin-left:9px; margin-right:9px; width:851px\">\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td colspan=\"10\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:1px solid black; height:21px; vertical-align:top; width:851px\">\r\n			<ol>\r\n				<li><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Cambria,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#4f81bd\"><a name=\"_Toc88149535\"> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Timelines (project plan and organization)</span></a></span></span></span></li>\r\n			</ol>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black; border-right:3px solid black; border-top:none; height:28px; vertical-align:top; width:193px\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Key milestones</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td colspan=\"9\" style=\"border-bottom:3px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; height:28px; vertical-align:top; width:658px\">\r\n			<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong>MONTH from project commencement (October 202 - June 2022)</strong></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; height:41px; vertical-align:top; width:193px\">\r\n			<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; height:41px; vertical-align:top; width:79px\">\r\n			<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style