if&quot;\">Screening 300 patients to be screened</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; height:12px; vertical-align:top; width:25%\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">20birr/pt.*300</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; height:12px; vertical-align:top; width:9%\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">6000</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; height:35px; vertical-align:top; width:44%\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Interview, collect a blood sample, store and&nbsp; analysis for 178 patients &nbsp;and physical measurements &nbsp;at&nbsp; baseline, 3<sup>rd</sup>, 6<sup>th</sup>, 9<sup>th</sup> months</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; height:35px; vertical-align:top; width:25%\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">100birr/questionnaire*178pts (intervention and control groups)*4 times*2 groups</sp