tion. Arch Organ Transplant. 2021;6:008&ndash;11. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">15. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; NoAgalar F, Eroglu E, Bulbul M, Agalar C, Tarhan OR, Sari M. Staged abdominal repair for treat- ment of moderate to severe secondary perito- nitis. World J Surg 2005; 29: 240-244. Title. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">16. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ching SS, Muralikrishnan VP, Whiteley GS. Relaparotomy: a five-year review of indications and outcome. Int J Clin Pract. 2003 May;57(4):333-7. PMID: 12800467. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">17. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 28. Mart&iacute;nez-Casas I, Sancho JJ, Nve E, Pons MJ, Membrilla E (2009) Preoperative risk factors for mortality after relaparotomy: analysis of 254 patients. Langenbecks Arch Surg 395(5): 527-534. 29. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">18. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Butler JA, Huang J, Wilson SE. Repeated Laparotomy for Postoperative Intra-abdominal Sepsis: An Analysis of Outcome Predictors. Arch Surg. 1987;122(6):702&ndash;706. doi:10.1001/archsurg.1987.01400180084016. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">19. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5. Hinsdale JG, Jaffe BM (1984) Re-operation for intra-abdominal sepsis. Ann Surg 199(1): 31-36. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">20. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Harbrecht PJ, Garrison RN, Fry DE (1984) Early urgent relaparotomy. Arch Surg 119(4): 369-374. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">21. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Patel H, Patel P, Shah DK. Relaparotomy in general surgery department of tertiary care hospital of Western India. Int Surg J. 2016;4(1):344. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">22. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Gyedu A. The Brain Drain Myth: Retention of Specialist Surgical Graduates in East, Central and Southern Africa 1974&ndash;2013. World J Surg. 2017;41(12):3054. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">23. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Koirala R, Mehta N, Varma V, Kapoor S, Kumaran V, Nundy S. Urgent Redo-Laparotomies: Patterns and Outcome-A Single Centre Experience. Indian J Surg 2015;77(3):195-9. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">24. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Koirala R, Mehta N, Varma V, Kapoor S, Kumaran V, Nundy S. Urgent Redo-Laparotomies: Patterns and Outcome&mdash;A Single Centre Experience. Indian J Surg. 2015;77(3):195&ndash;9. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">25. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Kiewiet JJS, Van Ruler O, Boermeester MA, Reitsma JB. A decision rule to aid selection of patients with abdominal sepsis requiring a relaparotomy. BMC Surg. 2013;13(1). </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">26. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; van Ruler O, Lamme B, Gouma DJ, et al: Variables associated with positive findings at relaparotomy in patients with secondary peritonitis. Crit Care Med 2007, 35:468&ndash;476. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">27. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Van Goor H. Interventional management of abdominal sepsis: when and how. Langenbecks Arch Surg. 2002 Oct;387(5-6):191-200. doi: 10.1007/s00423-002-0309-7. Epub 2002 Sep 4. PMID: 12410353. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">28. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Farthmann EH