oni L, Moore E, Malangoni M, et al. 2013 WSES guidelines for management of intra-abdominal infections. World J Emerg Surg. 2013;8(1):1&ndash;29. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">34. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Open_Abdomen_Management_Part_1_2010. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">35. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Verdant CL, Chierego M, De Moor V, Chamlou R, Creteur J, De Dieu Mutijima J, et al. Prediction of postoperative complications after urgent laparotomy by intraperitoneal microdialysis: A pilot study. Ann Surg. 2006 Dec;244(6):994&ndash;1002. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">36. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Perrone G, Sartelli M, Mario G, Chichom-Mefire A, Labricciosa FM, Abu-Zidan FM, et al. Management of intra-abdominal-infections: 2017 World Society of Emergency Surgery guidelines summary focused on remote areas and low-income nations. Int J Infect Dis. 2020;99:140&ndash;8. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">37. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Sartelli M, Chichom-Mefire A, Labricciosa FM, Hardcastle T, Abu-Zidan FM, Adesunkanmi AK, et al. The management of intra-abdominal infections from a global perspective: 2017 WSES guidelines for management of intra-