ri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:black\">24. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Tamiru W, Engidawork E, Asres K. Evaluation of the effects of 80% methanolic leaf extract of Caylusea abyssinica (fresen.) fisch. &amp; Mey. on glucose handling in normal, glucose loaded and diabetic rodents. BMC Complement Altern Med. 2012;12(151):1&ndash;7. </span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:black\">25. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Arora S, Ojha SK, Vohora D. Characterisation of Streptozotocin Induced Diabetes Mellitus in Swiss Albino Mice. Glob J Pharmacol. 2009;3(2):81&ndash;4. </span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:black\">26. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Roshan H, Nikpayam O, Sedaghat M, Sohrab G. Effects of green coffee extract supplementation on anthropometric indices, glycaemic control, blood pressure, lipid profile, insulin resistance and appetite in patients with the metabolic syndrome: A randomised clinical trial. Br J Nutr. 2018;119(3):250&ndash;8. </span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:43px; text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>','Evaluation of anti-diabetic effect of hydro-methanolic extract of green coffee beans in STZ-induced diabetic mice',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'Diabetic ,Green Coffee ,Jimma,Ethiopia',10,'<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; bord