tyle=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">10.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Cantwell R. Substance use and schizophrenia: effects on symptoms, social functioning and service use. The British Journal of Psychiatry. 2003;182(4):324-9.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">11.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Horticultural Therapy. Introduction and History. Available at: </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><a href=\"https://edisifasufledu/ep145\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"color:blue\">https://edisifasufledu/ep145</span></span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> Accessed on: 26/10/2020.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">12.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Lannigan EG, Noyes S. Occupational Therapy Interventions for Adults Living With Serious Mental Illness. Am J Occup Ther. 2019;73(5):p1-5.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">13.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Carpiniello B, Pinna F, Tusconi M, Zaccheddu E, Fatteri F. Gender differences in remission and recovery of schizophrenic and schizoaffective patients: preliminary results of a prospective cohort study. Schizophrenia research and treatment. 2012;2012.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">14.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Nawka A, Kalisova L, Raboch J, Giacco D, Cihal L, Onchev G, et al. Gender differences in coerced patients with schizophrenia. BMC Psychiatry. 2013;13(1):257.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">15.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; INOUE. HOaK. The Effects of Cooking Activities and Social Skills Training on Schizophrenics. A Comparison of Cognitive Function and Social Competence . Kawasaki Journal of Medical Welfare. 2014;19,( 2,):54-63.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">16.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Folsom DP, Depp C, Palmer BW, Mausbach BT, Golshan S, Fellows I, et al. Physical and mental health-related quality of life among older people with schizophrenia. Schizophr Res. 2009;108(1-3):207-13.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">17.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Brambilla P, Perlini C, Rajagopalan P, Saharan P, Rambaldelli G, Bellani M, et al. Illness severity and poor social functioning relate to hippocampal shrinkage in schizophrenia: a three-dimensional mapping study. The British journal of psychiatry: the journal of mental science. 2013;202(1):50.</span></span></span></span></p>','To evaluate the effects of occupational therapy on treatment outcomes of individuals with schizophrenia who are attending follow up treatment at Jimma Medical Center, Southwest, Ethiopia, 2021.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'occupational therapy, Adjuvant therapy,Schizophrenia',10,'<table align=\"center\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"TableGrid2\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border:none; width:560px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:1px solid black; height:44px; vertical-align:top; width:290px\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Key milestones</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:1px solid black; height:44px; vertical-align:top; width:270px\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">MONTH (from project commencement)</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; height:34px; vertical-align:top; width:90px\">\r\n			<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">January</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-top:none; height:34px; vertical-align:top; width:78px\">\r\n			<p